/-- Textual carrier for `Summable Means and Almost Sure Convergence`. -/
def rem_10_1_summable_means_intro : String :=
  "The next theorem shows that if the means of a sequence of nonnegative " ++
  "random variables converge to $0$ sufficiently fast, then the sequence must" ++
  " converge to $0$ almost surely. The proof illustrates how to use Theorem " ++
  "10.1 together with the Borel--Cantelli lemma to establish almost sure " ++
  "convergence."
